{
  "_about": [
    "The other plugins the OBVR release archive carries beside OBVR and OBNG (since beta 9,",
    "Nadi 2026-11-16), read by tools/package-release.py and tools/package-release.ps1.",
    "'from' is the plugin's release zip or its repository, relative to the folder that holds",
    "the OBVR repository (D:\\Modding, /run/media/nadi/Games/Modding). 'files' maps each archive",
    "name to a member of that zip (a backslash in a member's name read as a slash) or to a",
    "file in that folder. 'dll' names the archive entry that is the plugin, a 32-bit DLL whose",
    "SHA-256 must be 'sha256': the DLL Nadi plays with, so a rebuilt or swapped file cannot",
    "ship unseen (change the pin with the plugin). 'ini' sets values in the INI shipped,",
    "every key of it present in its section, or the archive is refused."
  ],
